<h1 class="heading">Your password was changed</h1>
<p class="subheading">
  Hi <strong>{{firstName}}</strong>, this is a confirmation that the password
  for your account was successfully changed.
</p>

<div class="info-box">
  <strong>Changed at:</strong> {{changedAt}}<br/>
  <strong>IP Address:</strong> {{ipAddress}}<br/>
  <strong>Device:</strong> {{userAgent}}
</div>

<div class="warning-box">
  <strong>Was this not you?</strong><br/>
  If you did not change your password, your account may be compromised.
  <a href="{{resetUrl}}" style="color:#92400e;font-weight:600;">Reset your password immediately</a>
  and contact support.
</div>

<div class="btn-wrapper">
  <a href="{{loginUrl}}" class="btn">Go to Sign In</a>
</div>